                <pb facs="0613" n="527" sameAs="frus:frus1873p1v1/pg527"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Captain Heriero to the Kanagawa Kencho.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Yokohama</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1872-08-30"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 30,
                        1872.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I respectfully request that the Chinese passengers who have been taken from on
                    board my ship, the bark Maria Luz, by order of this Kencho, be sent back again
                    today, they being bound by legal contracts deposited with the Kencho to proceed
                    to Peru.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>RICARDO HERIERO.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
